  "solution": "**Given :-**\n\n**0.5×0.5+0.09-0.15over0.125+0.027**\n\n**Concept Used :- **\n\na³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² + b² - ab)\n\n**Calculation :-**\n\n**0.5×0.5+0.09-0.15over0.125+0.027**\n\n⇒ 0.5×0.5+0.3×0.3-0.5×0.3over0.5³+0.3³\n\n⇒ 0.5²+0.3²-0.5×0.3over(0.5 + 0.3)(0.5²+0.3²-0.5×0.3)\n\n⇒ 1/(0.5 + 0.3)\n\n⇒ 1/0.8\n\n⇒ 10/8 = 5/4\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
